  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El Teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda ha acogido&nbsp;esta tarde dos&nbsp;representaciones del Bel&eacute;n de Navidad, a cargo del ballet del Centro de Danza de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia. A las 17 horas ha habido una representaci&oacute;n especial para la Tercea Edad.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_5200.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>A partir de las 18.30 horas ha sido la funci&oacute;n para el p&uacute;blico en general, mayoritariamente formado por padres, madres y familiares de las ni&ntilde;as y un ni&ntilde;o que han ofrecido un precioso espect&aacute;culo, al que pertenecen las fotos.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5148.jpg\" alt=\"img_5148\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5149.jpg\" alt=\"img_5149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5150.jpg\" alt=\"img_5150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5151.jpg\" alt=\"img_5151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5152.jpg\" alt=\"img_5152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5153.jpg\" alt=\"img_5153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5154.jpg\" alt=\"img_5154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletbelen/img_5155.jpg\" alt=\"img_5155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4